      "content": "For your Eurostar journey from London to Paris, each traveler can bring up to two checked bags for free. The maximum weight allowed for each bag is 32kg (70 pounds) and the length cannot exceed 86cm (34 inches). Regarding early arrival, it's recommended to be at St Pancras station by at least 30 minutes before departure time to smoothly go through security procedures. Enjoy your trip!",
